; tap2sna.py file for Bubbler. Run
;
;   $ tap2sna.py @bubbler.t2s
;
; to create a Z80 snapshot.

https://zxaaa.net/DENIED/Bubbler%20(1987)(Ultimate%20Play%20The%20Game).tzx
Bubbler.z80

--tape-name "BUBB.tzx"
--sim-load-config accelerator=speedlock

; The BASIC loader runs LOAD ""CODE and RANDOMIZE USR 32768 for the first code
; block, which draws the loading screen and copies a 23-byte stub to $F000.
; It then loads the game (encrypted) to $5E00 and calls RANDOMIZE USR 61440.
; The stub complements ($91B4 bytes) the game in place and jumps to $5E00.
; The simulation runs all of that, so stopping at the start address leaves the
; decrypted game at its real addresses with nothing else to do here.
--start 24064

; from tape block #7 to address 24064.
;--ram load=7,$5E00 ; 36888 bytes ; Game code (encrypted)
